<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Nov 6.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Nov 6.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				 Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Villa World	    10.68    1.03</p>
<p> 2   Prime Credit Tr	10.32    0.95</p>
<p> 3   Prop Income Inv	 9.96    1.02</p>
<p> 4   BT Prop Trust	   9.60    1.70</p>
<p> 5   Colonial Mutual	 9.29    1.12</p>
<p> 6   Indu Property	   9.29    0.98</p>
<p> 7   McIntosh Sec	    9.18    0.98</p>
<p> 8   Aust Tour		 9.04    0.83</p>
<p> 9   Centro Prop	     8.78    2.22</p>
<p>10   Armstrong Retail	8.68    0.76</p>
<p>11   Equitilink		8.62    0.58</p>
<p>12   Gandel Retail Tr	8.57    0.91</p>
<p>13   MT Leyshon Gold	 8.47    2.95</p>
<p>14   Advance Pro CB	  8.35    1.39</p>
<p>15   Gen Prop Tr	     8.34    2.41</p>
<p>16   Barclays Mirvac	 8.21    1.34</p>
<p>17   Capcount Prop	   8.19    0.83</p>
